  "description": "Approver consent queue for license reclamation (J2). Cards list flagged-inactive assignments in the approver's company scope: person, company, last-active date, 30/60/90 inactivity badge, license type/org and monthly cost. Consent is explicit — 'Liberar licencia' opens a confirm modal (never silent removal, per PRD) and 'Mantener' dismisses with a mandatory note. Analytics figures carry a FreshnessLabel (~3-day vendor delay).",
